
@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #333333
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
top to bottom direction
scale 0.85

rectangle "RBciAD Host (Python)" {
  rectangle "Reactive Engine" as Rx
  rectangle "Plugin API\n(Python nodes)" as PyAPI
  rectangle "Polyglot Wrapper" as Wrap
  rectangle "temp_io/" as TMP
}

rectangle "External process\n(C++/Rust/Node.js/R)" as EXT

Rx ..> PyAPI : in-process\nexecute
PyAPI --> Wrap : call external
Wrap --> TMP : write\ninput_<...>.json
Wrap --> EXT : spawn\nprocess
EXT --> TMP : write\noutput_<...>.json
TMP --> Wrap : read\noutput
Wrap --> PyAPI : outputs / errors
PyAPI --> Rx : return

note right of TMP
Use file paths for large arrays
(binary/memmap) when needed.
end note
@enduml
